  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria: Assisting the Reintegration of Returnees through Integrated Vocational and Entrepreneurship Support (ARRIVES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Assisting the Reintegration of Returnees through Integrated Vocational and Entrepreneurship Support (ARRIVES) project empowers Nigerian voluntary returnees with the skills and resources needed for sustainable economic reintegration back home - covering the entire return and reintegration process from pre-return to post-arrival.</narrative>
  </description>
